  "title": "Cherry Zest Coffee (Medium Roast)",
  "handle": "cherry-zest-coffee-medium-roast",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>Cherry Zest Coffee </strong>brings a bright, expressive taste that’s equal parts lively and rich. This <strong>single-origin medium roast </strong>combines citrusy acidity with a deep cocoa foundation, rounded out by notes of black cherry and soft fudge.</p><p><br></p><p>Sourced from Guatemala’s high-altitude regions, this coffee highlights Bourbon, Typica, and Caturra varietals. Bourbon provides a sweet, balanced profile with notes of red fruit and chocolate, while Typica adds clean structure and complexity. Caturra delivers bright acidity and a citrusy vibrancy, creating a coffee that’s both dynamic and smooth.</p><p><br></p><p>Crafted from beans grown in volcanic soils and washed for clarity, this brew captures the clean, fruit-forward characteristics that Guatemalan coffees are known for. Perfect for pour-over, French press, or drip brewing methods, it’s a flavorful cup with depth that never feels heavy.A spirited cup that zings with brightness, then settles into something deep and satisfying.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredients: </strong>100% Arabica whole beans</p><p><strong>Varietals:</strong> Bourbon, Typica, Caturra</p><p><strong>Acidity level: </strong>Medium</p><p><strong>Manufacturer's country: </strong>USA</p><p><strong>Regions:</strong> Guatemala, Huehuetenango/Antigua</p><p><strong>Product amount (oz/lb/g):</strong> 12 oz / 0.8 lb / 340g</p><p><strong>Gross weight (oz/lb/g): </strong>13.5 oz / 0.8 lb / 383 g</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Do not use if the packaging is damaged or opened. Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and moisture.</p> <p>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/4c36cdfa54b26cb4291c359dc2cd7910d868f8ae-125x181.png\" alt=\"Gluten-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/2390692fa16a1bad9ae4453609bcd8b61afbb0b2-149x180.png\" alt=\"Vegetarian\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/cc4066d915d42e195ee9cf5bbce01a99f006af1e-126x181.png\" alt=\"Lactose-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/f7e562d6bb212503da89f944a0d799171e6d48fe-125x181.png\" alt=\"Allergen-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/e2132e2f64f15727e375c7aa509fedd7bdcf1ae8-126x182.png\" alt=\"Hormone-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/28d7e07bb105f5cdb78b23808a653158de4f4b70-125x182.png\" alt=\"All natural\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/f99540cc3d3f192a68004f4518d57b0cd7c27aa7-125x181.png\" alt=\"Antibiotic-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/0e9fc04e2f9353234d2b7794b96613f19c576efb-126x183.png\" alt=\"Non-GMO\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/a007d72855c1d7a309b8b6dec5eadf939bb8a80d-125x181.png\" alt=\"Corn-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/392fe7a0ceded284f4aeb9c2eeb40c638917d6be-149x180.png\" alt=\"Vegan friendly\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/5d63559a8d2977b109844a6f2e231d646d51c76d-520x641.png\" alt=\"Halal\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/fcded08d85e2c6a9aa898fa2748178b41414fe13-126x182.png\" alt=\"Cruelty Free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\"></p>",
